00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:14.159
again in just a loop, repeating until a
goal is met. And that simple idea of

00:04:11.599 --> 00:04:18.400
calling an LLM multiple times is
something which turns out to allow us to

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:22.240
achieve much bigger goals than just
calling an LLM once with an input and

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:27.680
getting an output. And so that fourth
